    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/91620a5f88e0062e899075d3357e52a2.avif?t=1748857681\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Welcome to Surf 'n Turf</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world made of food and you are Munch, a lizard cook ready for an adventure...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surf 'n Turf</strong> is an Island-hopping, <strong>dish-making</strong> <strong>3D platformer</strong>. In Surf 'n Turf, you are a little lizard chef that gathers ingredients by hopping along islands with an expansive move set. Twirl and flip your way to the delicious-est dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/9eafc3a561f88b4e39ac2bfef379e35e.poster.avif?t=1748857681\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/9eafc3a561f88b4e39ac2bfef379e35e.webm?t=1748857681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/6774dc38e66f91f4817305cdcd661014.avif?t=1748857681\" width=650 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/1a2a4dd8842b65b92c821f3d085db622.poster.avif?t=1748857681\" width=650 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/1a2a4dd8842b65b92c821f3d085db622.webm?t=1748857681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/1a2a4dd8842b65b92c821f3d085db622.mp4?t=1748857681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Munch is quite the acrobat, and you can utilize his skills to traverse the platforming challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/a3aefc94e09d3a1846710ce35c7fb4c2.avif?t=1748857681\" width=650 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/71f9647382ab9425ceb06c7064570072.poster.avif?t=1748857681\" width=650 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/71f9647382ab9425ceb06c7064570072.webm?t=1748857681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/71f9647382ab9425ceb06c7064570072.mp4?t=1748857681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Munch is a chef, so use his culinary skills to make the best dishes the world has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/a3e65d6d1cf5cf564ee00a68bf77814b.avif?t=1748857681\" width=650 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/aa5f2ffd57c60083c251a05ac0cfdb96.poster.avif?t=1748857681\" width=650 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/aa5f2ffd57c60083c251a05ac0cfdb96.webm?t=1748857681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/aa5f2ffd57c60083c251a05ac0cfdb96.mp4?t=1748857681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Munch can go fast on a surfboard and hit some sick tricks. Making traveling to the next island a breeze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/c95860dc0ae2b55a5a052a4fd696c7b0.avif?t=1748857681\" width=650 height=159 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is the goal?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Surf 'n Turf you go around islands, where you find hungry, occasionally picky characters to make food for. You have limited time to prepare a dish and gather all the ingredients, watch the timer! While making the dish, you are managing:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The time that's running out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The specific ingredients you have to find for the dish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficult obstacles that you have to platform your way across.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These challenges will test your time management, platforming, and decision-making skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You win the challenge when you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get enough points with the dish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got the correct ingredients for your customer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Served the dish before the time ran out.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/91620a5f88e0062e899075d3357e52a2.avif?t=1748857681\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Welcome to Surf 'n Turf</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world made of food and you are Munch, a lizard cook ready for an adventure...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surf 'n Turf</strong> is an Island-hopping, <strong>dish-making</strong> <strong>3D platformer</strong>. In Surf 'n Turf, you are a little lizard chef that gathers ingredients by hopping along islands with an expansive move set. Twirl and flip your way to the delicious-est dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/9eafc3a561f88b4e39ac2bfef379e35e.poster.avif?t=1748857681\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/9eafc3a561f88b4e39ac2bfef379e35e.webm?t=1748857681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/6774dc38e66f91f4817305cdcd661014.avif?t=1748857681\" width=650 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/1a2a4dd8842b65b92c821f3d085db622.poster.avif?t=1748857681\" width=650 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514850/extras/1a2a4dd8842b65b92c821f3d085db622.webm?t=1748857681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><